  "sourceText": "Sesame Dressing\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 31, 2009 - 11:45pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 tablespoons sugar\n1 teaspoon salt\n1/2 teaspoon ground pepper\n1/2 tablespoon ground ginger\n1/4 cup salad oil\n1 tablespoon sesame oil\n5 tablespoons rice vinegar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place ingredients in salad dressing container and shake or mix well. Refrigerate at least 3 hours for best flavor.",
